  "prompt": "Return a list of length n + 1 where position i is the number of 1 bits in i. Aim for O(n) using answers you already computed.\n\nSignature:\n    def counting_bits(n: int) -> list[int]:\n\nExamples:\n    counting_bits(5) -> [0, 1, 1, 2, 1, 2]",
  "starter": "def counting_bits(n: int) -> list[int]:\n    # Your code here\n    pass\n",
